  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d2d620a50a09a5d4baece4cddcab39fc, type: 3}
  m_Name: AishaIntro
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  speakerName: Aisha the Rug Merchant
  lines:
  - Careful where you step, traveler - the wells here are older than the walls.
  - My rugs once hung in the palace. Now I trade stories for silence.
  - If you ever find a way past the palace gate, tell me what the ash did to the
    carpets.
